title: "The Stringer Bound Conjecture: Proofs, Computations, and Exact Certificates"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sater
    given-names: Richie
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RichieSater/stringer-bound"
url: "https://github.com/RichieSater/stringer-bound"
abstract: >-
  A certificate-backed investigation of finite-sample conservatism for the
  Stringer monetary-unit-sampling bound, including a proof for n = 2, exact
  rational counterexamples at low confidence, reproducible computation code,
  and machine-checkable certificates.
keywords:
  - Stringer bound
  - monetary-unit sampling
  - audit sampling
  - finite-sample coverage
  - exact arithmetic
  - computer-assisted proof
